{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "POKEMON TOWER F3 — HAUNTED VARIANT (Map 556).",
    "This is the pre-Silph-Scope version of F3. The player cannot",
    "identify the ghosts yet, so they are hostile spirits that warp",
    "the player back down to F2. All events use sprite 093 (ghost).",
    "",
    "Map 556 has NO structural overlap with Map 402 (normal F3).",
    "Map 402 has Channeler trainers and Ghostgirls; Map 556 has",
    "pure ghost encounters that kick the player out.",
    "",
    "Event 4 (Gengar): sprite 094, two pages. Page 0 sets SelfSwitch A.",
    "Page 1 shows text then warps to F2.",
    "Events 6-10, 12: ghost NPCs, each with one text line + warp.",
    "Event 11: Elixir item ball — no dialogue, preserved.",
    "",
    "Each ghost gets a unique Synthesis-flavored line rather than",
    "all saying the same thing. Theme: fusion has disturbed the dead.",
    "The spirits reference torn souls, wrong bodies, merged suffering.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line."
  ],
